   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">Hi, </span><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">I&#39;ve created a cluster w/o bootstrapping R but selecting --ami-version 3.0.4 (w/ R 3.0.1) and --hadoop-version 2.2.0.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">Executing an R script connecting via SSH (from Win7 box) to the MasterNode:</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><i style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">plink -ssh -i E:\\mykey.ppk <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">had...@ec2-xx-xx-xx-xxx.eu-west-1.compute.amazonaws.com</a> Rscript /home/hadoop/script.R /user/data/input /user/data/output/anomaly</i><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">I obtain the following error (w/ a non-sense string):</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><i style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">running</i><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><i style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">&#39;/usr/lib64/R/bin/R --slave --no-restore --file=/home/hadoop/script.R --args /user/data/input&#39;</i><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><i style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">Error in library(rmr2) : there is no package called ÔÇÿrmr2ÔÇÖ</i><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><i style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">Execution halted</i><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">Initial part of the script:</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><i style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">args &lt;- commandArgs()</i><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><i style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">Sys.setenv(HADOOP_CMD = &quot;/usr/bin/hadoop&quot;)</i><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><i style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">library(rmr2)</i><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><i style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">library(rhdfs)</i><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><i style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">hdfs.init()</i><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><i style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">if(hdfs.exists(args[7])) { hdfs.rmr(args[7]) }</i><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;backgrou