   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">What is missing is rmr2 itself and the mystery characters are quotes. If you don&#39;t install it, it won&#39;t work, that&#39;s one thing I know for a fact. Even if you do install it, EMR is incompatible enough with Hadoop that it shouldn&#39;t work. I checked the documentation again and it still looks like like it has proprietary changes. I don&#39;t see support for EMR coming any time soon, but if somebody submitted patches to that end I would look into them.<div>\r\n\r\n<br><div><div><br></div><div>Antonio</div></div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Fri, May 16, 2014 at 9:05 AM, Rob <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">nys...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n</div></div>"
